sequenceDiagram
    participant TUI as OpenCode TUI
    participant Plugin as TypeScript plugin
    participant Worker as Python worker
    participant Model as Voice model
    participant Audio as Audio device

    TUI->>Plugin: Execution succeeds
    Plugin->>Plugin: Select final reply and split into units
    Plugin->>Worker: Speak request with units and config
    Worker->>Model: Generate first unit
    Model-->>Worker: Audio
    Worker->>Audio: Play audio
    Note over Worker,Model: Chatterbox generates the next unit during playback
    Worker-->>Plugin: Done, cancelled, or error
